{"3028380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Isles of Arcana", "steam_appid": 3028380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028380/extras/13149d81fb91b9b2b8349e425d0d2cbd.webp?t=1781562667\" width=458 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore, craft, build and fight your way across dangerous lands as you attempt to restore balance to <strong>Arcana</strong> — alone or with up to 4 players in online co-op.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028380/extras/ba34c2280941ee7998885ffbf9c7bfc2.poster.avif?t=1781562667\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028380/extras/ba34c2280941ee7998885ffbf9c7bfc2.webm?t=1781562667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028380/extras/ba34c2280941ee7998885ffbf9c7bfc2.mp4?t=1781562667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028380/extras/526312296e5688a461bb2ccd2ff67bd5.webp?t=1781562667\" width=700 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You are a Guardian — an ancient protector of worlds, awakened as a last resort to save Arcana. A mysterious corruption is spreading relentlessly and consuming the planet. Arcana is the only known source of Mytonium in the universe — the resource that powers all of Earth’s technology and sustains celestial forces. If Arcana falls, everything falls with it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028380/extras/c09de827db5293ff436bda0ba270123d.poster.avif?t=1781562667\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028380/extras/c09de827db5293ff436bda0ba270123d.webm?t=1781562667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028380/extras/c09de827db5293ff436bda0ba270123d.mp4?t=1781562667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028380/extras/0e3477a5d32c60d2f64ba9488490026d.webp?t=1781562667\" width=559 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028380/extras/c9b64fb24dcab51df094d4589524505d.poster.avif?t=1781562667\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028380/extras/c9b64fb24dcab51df094d4589524505d.webm?t=1781562667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028380/extras/c9b64fb24dcab51df094d4589524505d.mp4?t=1781562667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Rebuild what was destroyed by creating homes, restoring safe havens, and bringing life back to the world. As you grow your settlement, survivors will return — each with their own skills, trades, and knowledge to aid your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fish, mine, craft, and develop your abilities as you help rebuild a world worth saving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028380/extras/a4a13e6bed717b0299ea8d6c0f85ffec.avif?t=1781562667\" width=643 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Join forces with other Guardians and push back the corruption as you explore, build, and survive together. Team up with up to 4 players in online co-op.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028380/extras/13149d81fb91b9b2b8349e425d0d2cbd.webp?t=1781562667\" width=458 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore, craft, build and fight your way across dangerous lands as you attempt to restore balance to <strong>Arcana</strong> — alone or with up to 4 players in online co-op.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028380/extras/ba34c2280941ee7998885ffbf9c7bfc2.poster.avif?t=1781562667\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028380/extras/ba34c2280941ee7998885ffbf9c7bfc2.webm?t=1781562667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028380/extras/ba34c2280941ee7998885ffbf9c7bfc2.mp4?t=1781562667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028380/extras/526312296e5688a461bb2ccd2ff67bd5.webp?t=1781562667\" width=700 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You are a Guardian — an ancient protector of worlds, awakened as a last resort to save Arcana. A mysterious corruption is spreading relentlessly and consuming the planet. Arcana is the only known source of Mytonium in the universe — the resource that powers all of Earth’s technology and sustains celestial forces. If Arcana falls, everything falls with it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028380/extras/c09de827db5293ff436bda0ba270123d.poster.avif?t=1781562667\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028380/extras/c09de827db5293ff436bda0ba270123d.webm?t=1781562667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028380/extras/c09de827db5293ff436bda0ba270123d.mp4?t=1781562667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028380/extras/0e3477a5d32c60d2f64ba9488490026d.webp?t=1781562667\" width=559 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028380/extras/c9b64fb24dcab51df094d4589524505d.poster.avif?t=1781562667\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028380/extras/c9b64fb24dcab51df094d4589524505d.webm?t=1781562667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028380/extras/c9b64fb24dcab51df094d4589524505d.mp4?t=1781562667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Rebuild what was destroyed by creating homes, restoring safe havens, and bringing life back to the world. As you grow your settlement, survivors will return — each with their own skills, trades, and knowledge to aid your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fish, mine, craft, and develop your abilities as you help rebuild a world worth saving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028380/extras/a4a13e6bed717b0299ea8d6c0f85ffec.avif?t=1781562667\" width=643 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Join forces with other Guardians and push back the corruption as you explore, build, and survive together. Team up with up to 4 players in online co-op.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "You are a Guardian, sent to a world consumed by corruption. Explore increasingly dangerous biomes, gather resources, craft powerful tools, and uncover lost technology as you fight to save Arcana. Play solo or with up to four players.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028380/c6e3a269a160b44f687b415e4a1f3700e9ecd50f/header.jpg?t=1781562667", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028380/4f934239d103865029da577252c6c596b3ea5abb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781562667", "capsule_imagev5": "https://share